        "tc.research_page.CORELIQUID.1"
      ],
      "translations": {
        "zh_cn": {
          "find": "尽管移液傀儡常常被指示去用水桶盛装世界中的流体方块,但受限于材料允许,每样物品,它们仅仅能携带100mb的液体.",
          "replace": {
            "text": "移液容量为原始搬运量平方根向下取整×1000 mB，再乘服务器搬运倍率；世界中的液体按整桶取用。"
          },
          "count": 1
        },
        "en_us": {
          "find": "A decanting golem can only carry 100mb of liquid per item its material type is normally allowed to carry, though they will always carry a full buckets worth if instructed to pick up liquids blocks in the world.",
          "replace": {
            "text": " Liquid capacity is floor(sqrt(unscaled carrying capacity)) × 1000 mB, multiplied by the server cargo multiplier. World fluids are collected in whole buckets."
          },
          "count": 1
        }
      }
    },
